    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "This is caused by our dependency on `react-instantsearch-core@6` which itself requires this precise version of the helper. I think we can probably (in another PR) remove the only test that requires the old library ([/packages/react-instantsearch-core/src/__tests__/compat.test.tsx](https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch/blob/master/packages/react-instantsearch-core/src/__tests__/compat.test.tsx)), because we can basically assert the same with any container which is the correct `<InstantSearch>`, and the message is tested in `useInstantSearch.test.ts`.",
    "commit_id": "de269f05901998a07dab2cd0b4b1ba98e6e22947",
    "created_at": "2023-09-13T14:16:37Z",
    "diff_hunk": "@@ -8554,6 +8554,13 @@ ajv@^8.0.1:\n     require-from-string \"^2.0.2\"\n     uri-js \"^4.2.2\"\n \n+algoliasearch-helper@3.14.0:\n+  version \"3.14.0\"\n+  resolved \"https://registry.npmjs.org/algoliasearch-helper/-/algoliasearch-helper-3.14.0.tgz#2409c2591952719ab6fba1de77b3bbe5094ab85e\"\n+  integrity sha512-gXDXzsSS0YANn5dHr71CUXOo84cN4azhHKUbg71vAWnH+1JBiR4jf7to3t3JHXknXkbV0F7f055vUSBKrltHLQ==\n+  dependencies:\n+    \"@algolia/events\" \"^4.0.1\"\n+",
